{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/ca35a9701f7ae936dd79870825b7f3c2.poster.avif?t=1768319815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/ca35a9701f7ae936dd79870825b7f3c2.webm?t=1768319815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/ca35a9701f7ae936dd79870825b7f3c2.mp4?t=1768319815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter The Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erebos Loop</strong> is a challenging retro sci-fi roguelite shooter with fast-paced, top-down combat and  progression across 50,000 procedurally generated levels. In Erebos, progress and survival depend solely on your skill and your ability to observe, adapt, and uncover the hidden rules of the Loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a thriving network connecting star systems and galaxies, Erebos was devastated by the Hostiles, whose quantum interference shattered its fabric. Now, both humans and Hostiles are trapped within the Loop. As an Operative of the Erebos Restoration Corps, it is your mission to uncover the mysteries of the Loop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Coordinate System &amp; Override Terminals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The heart of Erebos Loop is the Coordinate System and Override Terminals, a feature that introduces an innovative twist on the roguelite genre.</strong> Every level, with its treasures, enemies, and unique challenges, as well as every shop and upgrade room, has coordinates you can record and revisit. Use Override Terminals to plan your route, replay favorite challenges, and craft your perfect Loop. This system turns every run into a tactical puzzle and rewards strategy and careful planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/e3091145f3afd359577b3e6a7c1da1fa.poster.avif?t=1768319815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/e3091145f3afd359577b3e6a7c1da1fa.webm?t=1768319815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/e3091145f3afd359577b3e6a7c1da1fa.mp4?t=1768319815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expeditions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expeditions are focused operations with clear objectives and escalating danger.</strong> Take on five story-driven missions that uncover untold secrets about Erebos, and prove your mastery in five elite assignments designed to push your skills to the limit. Expeditions complement the Loop by offering structured goals while still testing your strategy and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/3b14fced123ee9159f9dcc4be3dc5ca8.poster.avif?t=1768319815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/3b14fced123ee9159f9dcc4be3dc5ca8.webm?t=1768319815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/3b14fced123ee9159f9dcc4be3dc5ca8.mp4?t=1768319815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Light permanent progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erebos Loop features a light, skill-focused progression. Unlock five powerful Boosts and Boost Slots by completing Loops and Expeditions, and equip them before your run to refine your strategy. Complete all Expeditions to unlock <strong>Iron Will Mode</strong>, the ultimate test of mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/9da92f7de0f56244acb94000be6699da.poster.avif?t=1768319815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/9da92f7de0f56244acb94000be6699da.webm?t=1768319815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/9da92f7de0f56244acb94000be6699da.mp4?t=1768319815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50,000 procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced top-down combat with hundreds of enemy, weapon, armor, and upgrade variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own run: record the coordinates behind specific encounters and equipment and use Override Terminals to shape future Loops.\u00a0Each Loop rewards observation, memory, and experimentation: every discovery will strengthen your next Loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light roguelite progression with unlockable Boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high-difficulty Iron Will Mode for the hardcore players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the nature of the Erebos Loop through handcrafted Expeditions and Command assignments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun your way through the Loop or try to beat your high scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted pixel art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of symphonic metal and atmospheric sci-fi soundtracks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you break the Erebos Loop?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Induction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867660/ee069025110bd06ef76f3d76121ce0db88e0dcc2.jpg"},{"name":"Phase Gate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867660/43e840c389177d286f793b3ca8f04c7d7e9a8fe0.jpg"},{"name":"Shard Runner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867660/2ea75c9053a63ce93378932aa050f5e3e5c780fc.jpg"},{"name":"Loop Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867660/7a7f1a229fd715beae9fad2ac665223652fb697a.jpg"},{"name":"Termination","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867660/ee64591f9475a32a7be0a2fbceb8c58984ee1f2e.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867660/7b020d3401a42f46da527b717233d047b10f8656.jpg"},{"name":"Loop Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867660/a9da85078cc792f996c5f7ac7df1ee4da8581eb0.jpg"},{"name":"Loop Specialist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867660/79dcbc54a2bc427f56d20dbe1e0e4cb96eea556a.jpg"},{"name":"Holoroom Override","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867660/8382c3d0542f8338144eb96ba0c30772726c7c5e.jpg"},{"name":"Phase Gate Override","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3867660/1a9867476e55c82320942d7d3295fc436d20024b.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867660?t=1768319815","background_raw"